import{_ as t,o,c as i,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 163 | Realm Refinement · Origin Realm | Predatory Faction vs. Symbiotic Faction","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 163 | Realm Refinement · Origin Realm | Predatory Faction vs. Symbiotic Faction","no":163,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Origin Realm","Predatory Faction","Symbiotic Faction","Plane Overlord","Path Comparison"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","17-Plane Transcendent Standard","04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0163_模块1-本源境-掠夺派vs共生派对比.md","filePath":"en/0163_模块1-本源境-掠夺派vs共生派对比.md"}'),a={name:"en/0163_模块1-本源境-掠夺派vs共生派对比.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,h,m){return o(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-163-origin-realm-predatory-faction-vs-symbiotic-faction-detailed-comparison" tabindex="-1">Entry 163 | Origin Realm: Predatory Faction vs. Symbiotic Faction Detailed Comparison <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-163-origin-realm-predatory-faction-vs-symbiotic-faction-detailed-comparison" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 163 | Origin Realm: Predatory Faction vs. Symbiotic Faction Detailed Comparison&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 17, 04</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-cosmos-master-and-cosmos-gatekeeper-one-character-difference" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Cosmos master and cosmos gatekeeper, one character difference <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-cosmos-master-and-cosmos-gatekeeper-one-character-difference" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Cosmos master and cosmos gatekeeper, one character difference&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin Realm is the apex of the nine realms, and the ultimate examination hall for the two civilizational paths&#39; divergence. Per the Plane Transcendent Standard (Document 17), Origin Realm strong ones can mobilize cosmic origin and fine-tune cosmic laws. When this power falls into the <strong>Predatory</strong> hand, it is the coronation of &quot;cosmos master&quot;; when it falls into the <strong>Symbiotic</strong> hand, it is the responsibility of &quot;cosmos gatekeeper.&quot; This entry puts the two paths&#39; complete differences in the Origin Realm on the table.</p><p>The six top-level axioms running through the text are precisely the symbiotic faction&#39;s fundamental negation of the predatory worldview: the anti-predation axiom opposes &quot;cosmos masters enslaving beings&quot;; the republican axiom of Myriad Races opposes &quot;one race one person monopolizing the cosmos&quot;; the collective ascension axiom opposes &quot;alone achieving immortality&quot;; the causal self-discipline axiom opposes &quot;casually changing beings&#39; fates&quot;; the law-first axiom opposes &quot;plot-style heaven-emperors.&quot; Per Anti-Predation Core Treatise (Document 04) and Document 17, unfolding the systematic comparison; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-overview-comparison-table" tabindex="-1">I. Overview Comparison Table <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-overview-comparison-table" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Overview Comparison Table&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Predatory Origin Strong One</th><th>Symbiotic Origin Strong One</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Identity</td><td>Cosmos master / heaven-emperor / overlord</td><td>Plane Transcendent / cosmos gatekeeper</td></tr><tr><td>Relation to beings</td><td>Master and slave, beings as chives</td><td>Guardian and server, beings equal</td></tr><tr><td>Law fine-tuning</td><td>Authoritarian by own will, for private gain</td><td>Co-governed by filing, for beings&#39; welfare</td></tr><tr><td>Immortality</td><td>Alone immortal, high above</td><td>Near-immortal but bearing 30% public responsibility</td></tr><tr><td>Power source</td><td>Personal power + protagonist uniqueness</td><td>Four-dimensional assessment + Myriad Races mandate</td></tr><tr><td>Supervision</td><td>None, no one can control</td><td>Alaya Network + four-dimensional assessment + co-governance</td></tr><tr><td>Ending</td><td>Overthrown by stronger, cosmos internal strife</td><td>Large Transcendent group, cosmos perpetually ascends</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="ii-identity-cosmos-master-vs-cosmos-gatekeeper" tabindex="-1">II. Identity: Cosmos Master vs. Cosmos Gatekeeper <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-identity-cosmos-master-vs-cosmos-gatekeeper" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Identity: Cosmos Master vs. Cosmos Gatekeeper&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Predatory reaching the Origin Realm self-styles &quot;cosmos master.&quot; He believes cosmic origin is his war booty, beings are his subjects (actually slaves), and laws are his private implements. Its psychological root is the sentient-origin greed-shortcut inner demon&#39;s cosmic-level form — treating the entire cosmos as a cake that can be privately owned.</p><p>The Symbiotic reaching the Origin Realm self-assumes &quot;cosmos gatekeeper.&quot; He believes cosmic origin belongs to all things, beings are equal life he must guard, and laws are public assets he must optimize. His power comes from four-dimensional assessment and Myriad Races mandate, not personal martial force.</p><p>The root of this divergence is put most transparently by Document 17: the predatory era&#39;s &quot;plane overlord&quot; enslaves the plane by force, the symbiotic civilization&#39;s &quot;Plane Transcendent&quot; guards the plane by force — one character difference, two civilizational paths.</p><h2 id="iii-law-fine-tuning-authoritarian-vs-co-governance" tabindex="-1">III. Law Fine-Tuning: Authoritarian vs. Co-Governance <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-law-fine-tuning-authoritarian-vs-co-governance" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Law Fine-Tuning: Authoritarian vs. Co-Governance&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Predatory fine-tunes cosmic laws by own will, for private gain — wherever there are resources, he changes laws to shapes favorable to himself; wherever there is resistance, he changes laws into suppression tools.</p><p>The Symbiotic fine-tunes cosmic laws through filing, for beings&#39; welfare — observe first, then limited operation, only relay knowledge, do not disturb causality; major changes must be co-discussed by the Anchor Council and Symbiosis Court. He changes laws to make beings live better, not to make himself stronger.</p><p>One judgment criterion: this law fine-tuning ultimately benefits one person, or makes billions of beings stretch more? The former is master, the latter is gatekeeper.</p><h2 id="iv-immortality-and-responsibility-monopoly-vs-obligation" tabindex="-1">IV. Immortality and Responsibility: Monopoly vs. Obligation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-immortality-and-responsibility-monopoly-vs-obligation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Immortality and Responsibility: Monopoly vs. Obligation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Predatory pursues immortality to forever monopolize supremacy — he wants to forever ride on beings&#39; heads.</p><p>The Symbiotic accepts near-immortality, but bears annual 30% time-energy public responsibility (Document 17 strongman mandatory service) — he wants to forever stand beside beings. Immortality is not a reward to him, but a longer service term.</p><h2 id="v-power-structure-monopoly-vs-co-governance" tabindex="-1">V. Power Structure: Monopoly vs. Co-Governance <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-power-structure-monopoly-vs-co-governance" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Power Structure: Monopoly vs. Co-Governance&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Predatory Origin strong one maintains rule by &quot;protagonist uniqueness&quot; — the cosmos can have only one strongest, and he is that one. This structure inevitably heads to internal strife: once a stronger one appears, the old master is immediately overthrown, the cosmos spins in place; this is precisely the predatory system&#39;s &quot;extremely high protagonist uniqueness dependence&quot; dead spot.</p><p>The Symbiotic Origin strong one relies on &quot;group co-governance&quot; — the 20% Activation Strategy deliberately cultivates a large group of Transcendents, every race has a representative, no one can authoritatively rule the cosmos. This structure is perpetual: strong ones emerge in numbers rather than one family monopolizing, protagonist uniqueness dependence drops to extremely low.</p><h2 id="vi-typical-ending-comparison" tabindex="-1">VI. Typical Ending Comparison <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-typical-ending-comparison" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Typical Ending Comparison&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Predatory Origin strong one: enjoying momentary supremacy on the god-throne, ultimately falling in internal strife, rebellion, or his own causal backlash; the cosmos he enslaved collapses with him</li><li>Symbiotic Origin strong one: becoming a permanent node of the anchor network, his law optimization experience benefiting later generations; the cosmos continuously ascends in co-governance</li></ul><h2 id="vii-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">VII. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#vii-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VII. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the Predatory wastes the cosmos&#39; scarcest origin power on &quot;maintaining one-person supremacy&quot;; the Symbiotic converts it into public momentum for Myriad Races ascension</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: this entry&#39;s thesis — master and gatekeeper, one private one public, two cosmic paths</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style Transcendents rely on protagonist uniqueness to authoritatively rule the cosmos; Heng Yuan Zhou Transcendents are constrained by four-dimensional assessment and co-governance, perpetually serving</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the symbiotic Transcendent group defaults five-genealogy every race has a representative; the predatory cosmos only holds one master</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the symbiotic law optimization and cosmic cognition are network-shared; the predatory &quot;god-throne&quot; is never open</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin Realm is the answer examination hall to the ultimate question &quot;whose servant is the strongman.&quot; The power of cosmic origin, used to master beings or to guard beings, determines whether one is predatory or symbiotic. A master, however strong, is only one person&#39;s god-throne; a gatekeeper, however humble, guards the home of ten thousand generations of beings. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer is written in the four-dimensional assessment: only the hand willing to bear responsibility for beings is worthy of touching cosmic origin.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./17-位面至高强者标准.html">17-Plane Transcendent Standard</a> · <a href="./04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a> · <a href="./23-20%激活战略规划.html">23-20% Activation Strategy</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const p=t(a,[["render",r]]);export{u as __pageData,p as default};
